description_en:
The powerful steamer positioned inside the combustion chamber covers the entire wall for its entire height and guarantees abundant steam production even in the presence of a continuous work cycle, rapid recovery times and homogeneous steam distribution throughout the trolley;
A lateral space must be provided for maintenance of the rear heat-exchanger.

The burner is posterior;

The glass can be removed for easy cleaning;

The steamer is fixed and at the full height of the chamber.
